.ruff_cache/
# Generated per machine by `make lsp`: it carries an absolute path to the dev
# virtualenv, which is not the same one on anybody else's disk.
pyrightconfig.json

# Agent-control files never ship. `omarchy plugin add` clones this repository
# into a directory a coding agent may later work in or under, so a CLAUDE.md,
# an AGENTS.md or a SKILL.md committed here becomes an instruction channel into
# somebody else's agent — one that has nothing to do with the reviewed daemon,
# and that this plugin, of all plugins, must not open. Keep whatever your own
# tooling writes; git just never carries it. `make agents` enforces this.
.agentfiles/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.gemini/
.aider*
.clinerules
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
